# Scenario: Wand of Light vs White Worm Mass
# Tests that Wand of Light works on worm masses (issue #232).
#
# Setup: Teleport (wizard mode), create a Wand of Light, pick it up,
# summon a White Worm Mass nearby, exit wizard mode, let the bot fight.
#
# Extend this pattern for other targets:
#   "and summon a {flavor} Worm Mass"
#   e.g. Green Worm Mass, Blue Worm Mass, etc.
#
# Usage:
#   bash scripts/crawl_metric.sh --init-file scripts/scenarios/wand_of_light_vs_white_worm_mass.init --max-turns 100

# Teleport to enter wizard mode
C-t
sleep

# Create a Wand of Light (^i = Tab in tmux)
Tab
Wand of Light
Enter
sleep

# Pick it up
g
sleep

# Summon a White Worm Mass (^s = summon)
C-s
White Worm Mass
Enter
sleep

# Exit wizard mode
C-w
xyzzy
Enter
